   "body": "<!-- ccr-overview-v2 -->\n\n### \ud83d\udfe1 Changes recommended\n\nRepository-managed compiler installs still pin gh-aw v0.89.21, so regenerating workflows can undo the runtime upgrades; align those pins with v1.0.1 and regenerate the maintenance workflow.\n\n<details open>\n<summary><strong>1 open issue</strong></summary>\n\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Upgrade compiler pins and regenerate maintenance workflow](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/14910#discussion_r4449348131) \u00b7 New\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>What changed in this PR</strong></summary>\n\nRegenerates GitHub CLI\u2019s Dependabot and issue-triage workflows with gh-aw v1.0.1, superseding #14716 by keeping dependency references and generated manifests consistent.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Upgrades generated token-action references to v3.3.0 and refreshes runtime and container pins.\n- Incorporates compiler-generated changes to context handling, detection, artifact redaction, and usage reporting.\n- Updates action-lock metadata while leaving workflow Markdown definitions unchanged.\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| `.github/\u200bworkflows/\u200bissue-triage.lock.yml` | Regenerates issue triage with updated dependencies and runtime handling. |\r\n| `.github/\u200bworkflows/\u200bdependabot-triage.lock.yml` | Regenerates Dependabot triage, including Go setup and runtime updates. |\r\n| `.github/\u200baw/\u200bactions-lock.json` | Pins the v1.0.1 setup action and removes obsolete setup entries. |\n</details>\n\n<sub>Review effort: Balanced</sub>",
